/- English proof (translation)
Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Assume the hypotheses and unpack their components.

Split into cases according to the possible forms of the given data. Treat this case separately. Treat this case separately. Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities.

Reduce the conclusion to the remaining proof obligations. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Extract witnesses or component facts from the available result. Supply the required witnesses or components. A detailed English derivation is pending.
